    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c0b35c9e8a36ec221252d3a"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The rest of the [[DM.Factions[faction_FourHorsemen],Four Horsemen]] disappeared right after we defeated them but the Kurgan is no more, we buried his body right next to the location where we salvaged his [[DM.MechDefs[mechdef_atlas_AS7-D-HT],Atlas II]].\n\nEven though it is extremely rare nowadays, finding a [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreRoyal],Royal]] BattleMech is still more likely to happen than being immortal, I would say.",
