    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c427b37c9eeb32dcb7b6fdb"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Claims of immortality aren't so far fetched, the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBelters],Belters]] in Terra have long been rumored to possess medical knowledge allowing them to live hundreds of years in zero gravity.\n\nThe most bizarre aspect was really the head hunting done by the Kurgan and his Four Horsemen followers.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 2,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cf2b2b14eb446fb9944a972"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cab4225bafb5b4e7aacee78"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The original contract had an original date of 2826, more than two hundred years ago and right before the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[Lore2ndSuccessionWar],Second Succession War]].\n\nThere's no way the Kurgan or the Horsemen could live that long, it would mean that they were born during the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreStarLeague],Star League]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c3c3455280d2410d601eaa8"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cbae8e8db8379d49b97c00a"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "That's why they kept it a secret if it exists, Darius, otherwise everyone would be prying the technology out of the Belters' hands.\n\nAnd there are other theorized means of humans skipping decades or even centuries, some studied before JumpShips made interstellar travel nearly instantaneous.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "How, Dr. Murad?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc3012132e23063f594161e"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c714600f4eac7373f54c7f3"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The obvious would be through the use of lostech [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreStasisTube],stasis tubes]], allowing for the Kurgan to only wake up for short periods of time while preserving itself.\n\nBut there is also another way, if the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreKearnyFuchida],Kearny-Fuchida]] drive misfires and there is a [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMisjump],misjump]], it is possible for the JumpShip to be thrown forwards in time.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb1c5622f8ba3449abf5796"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c090a48a4c0934099e72591"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Listen to yourselves, you're sounding just like some sort of lurid [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHolovid],holovid]] involving a fantasy world where it's usual to cut people's heads.\n\nWe were dealing with psychotic murderers who suffered from extreme delusions, there's nothing more to it.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb6d47fed0018c9a8dcccaa"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cdec75734468b430aed2fa9"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Yang, you are too dismissive of the immortality claims made by Colonel MacLeod and the Kurgan, when you would usually be the one more likely to admit or discuss these stories.\n\nWhy are you acting differently today?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c58503263cdb7b4092f60fb"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9caeba18b69ac2f5ca653913"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Whomever the Kurgan was, I am glad that we do not have to deal anymore with these kind of psychopaths.\n\nAnd I think I'd sleep better knowing that there aren't 'immortal' beings running around in the galaxy while collecting human heads.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cd45adb2f345bbc1d4503a7"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
